## ISS-020: NSIS installer version does not match build props

### File
`/root/Redball/installer/Redball.nsi`

### Original
```nsis
!define PRODUCT_VERSION "2.1.443.0"
!define PRODUCT_VERSION_SHORT "2.1.443"
```

### Replacement
```nsis
!define PRODUCT_VERSION "2.1.720.0"
!define PRODUCT_VERSION_SHORT "2.1.720"
```

### Reason
Aligns the NSIS installer version with `Directory.Build.props` so the published installer matches the assembly version.

### Verification
`grep PRODUCT_VERSION installer/Redball.nsi` and `grep Version Directory.Build.props` should show the same release.
